 "description": "The BitLocker Dump Filter module is a multi-chip standalone software-hybrid cryptographic module that protects crash dump files on BitLocker-encrypted computers. The module is part of the system dump stack. When the dump stack is called during a crash, the module ensures that all data is encrypted before being written to storage as a dump file.",
